# great-pm — Compiled Brain

> Long-memory layer. Each agent appends a 1–3 line synthesis after writing
> its artefact. The SubagentStart hook injects the most-recent 40 lines
> into every subagent invocation so nothing runs cold.
>
> Format: newest entries at the BOTTOM (so `tail -40` returns recent).
> Each entry: `## <YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM> | <agent> | <topic>` + 1–3 line synthesis.

